t  polls his campaign took in about 19  million  for the quarter cementing mayor Pete's  place in the top tier but the Trump  campaign wins the day it just announced  a presidential fundraising record along  with the Republican National Committee  it raised a hundred and twenty five  million dollars over the last three  months and to put that in perspective  former President Obama and the DNC  raised about seventy million over the  same period eight years ago but it's a  big haul Kristen thank you
 

